{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-lucky-oasis-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"lucky-oasis-residence-lucky-aeon-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Lucky Oasis Residence is a residential complex consisting of 15 floors, which was developed in the JVC (Jumeirah Village Circle). The developer of this project is Lucky Aeon.In this building, luxury and comfort are ideally combined with functionality and thoughtfulness in every detail.Lucky Oasis Residence offers a choice of studios, one, two and three bedroom apartments. Every detail of the interior is chosen and thought out with the utmost care to make your life better. Here you can show your refined taste and enjoy increased comfort.In the kitchen you will find sophisticated design that is ideally combined with functionality. From sleek countertops to high-quality appliances, every element is designed to transform your culinary experience.If you love golf, then the state-of-the-art simulator will allow you to enjoy realistic gameplay and virtual courses from around the world. For fitness enthusiasts, there is a fully equipped gym with the most modern machines and the ability to create an individual training program.If you are looking for a place to practice yoga, then a yoga room is the perfect choice. Here you can improve your mindfulness and relaxation through a variety of activities and meditation sessions.Just 15 minutes from the complex is Burj Al Arab, 20 minutes from Palm Jumeirah, Burj Khalifa and Mall of the Emirates, and 30 minutes from Dubai International Airport.","price":632999,"title":"Lucky Oasis Residence","bitrix":{"id":737,"pf_id":"are.2.13789","source":null,"project_id":"Lucky Oasis Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Lucky Oasis Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Lucky Aeon","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpj